<view class="management-shell" style="{{chromeStyle}}"><view class="topbar"><button class="topbar__back {{navigating?'control--disabled':''}}" bindtap="back" disabled="{{navigating}}" aria-label="返回"><image class="topbar__back-icon" src="/assets/icons/arrow-left-ink.svg"/></button><text class="topbar__title">订单管理</text></view><view class="page page--stack management-orders-page"><text class="subtitle">查看待支付、已支付、取消和超时订单。收货信息仅在详情页按权限读取。</text><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在加载订单…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="state state--error"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{refreshing}}" class="state">正在更新订单…</view><view class="management-order-list"><button wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="management-order-row {{!coreReady||navigating?'control--disabled':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open" disabled="{{!coreReady||navigating}}"><view class="management-order-row__head"><strong>{{item.orderNumber}}</strong><text>{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view><small>{{item.createdLabel}}</small><view class="management-order-row__foot"><text>{{item.summary}}</text><strong>¥{{item.totalYuan}}</strong><image src="/assets/icons/caret-right-muted.svg"/></view></button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading&&!error&&!items.length}}" class="state">当前没有订单记录。</view><button wx:if="{{nextCursor}}" class="secondary {{!coreReady||loadingMore?'secondary--disabled':''}}" bindtap="loadMore" loading="{{loadingMore}}" disabled="{{!coreReady||loadingMore}}">加载更多</button><view class="privacy-note"><image src="/assets/icons/lock-key-plum.svg"/><text>收货信息仅向有权限的工作人员显示。</text></view></view></view>
